title: "CESIS chart-recovery pipeline (ISHI edition)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ayektadev/cesis-pipeline"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Open-source pipeline that converts scanned handwritten surgical charts into a
  structured case log, using on-device OCR page classification, form-specific
  vision-language-model extraction, and rule-based reconciliation.
keywords:
  - global surgery
  - medical records
  - optical character recognition
  - vision-language model
  - low- and middle-income countries
